{"pageid":4804,"title":"Enchanted Snow Globe","displaytitle":"Enchanted Snowglobe","revid":20788,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Enchanted Snowglobe</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/Enchanted_Snowglobe.png/revision/latest?cb=20251216122631\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Enchanted Snowglobe\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/Enchanted_Snowglobe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251216122631\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/Enchanted_Snowglobe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20251216122631 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/73/Enchanted_Snowglobe.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20251216122631 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Enchanted Snowglobe\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Enchanted_Snowglobe.png\" data-image-name=\"Enchanted Snowglobe.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Spawns a snow globe?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.97.5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<blockquote><p><i>\"A snowglobe unlike any other, providing deeply rich and magical powers!\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Enchanted Snowglobe</b> is an object that can spawn from the <a href=\"/wiki/Santa_Airdrop\" title=\"Santa Airdrop\">Santa Airdrop</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/2025_Christmas_Event\" title=\"2025 Christmas Event\">2025 Christmas Event</a>.\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p>\nInteracting with it causes it to spawn a snow globe somewhere in the map and uses the item, deleting it and sending the alert:</p><blockquote><p><b>Christmas Snowglobe</b></p></blockquote><blockquote><p><i>A very festive snowglobe has been summoned!</i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p><b>Enchanted Snowglobe</b> is a small snow globe about 2x2x2 units in size. It has a gold base with a sparkling dome on top, wearing 2 shine effects. A little bit of snow can be seen piled in it, with some floating around.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The correct term is actually \"Snow Globe\", it's spelled incorrectly in the game.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163204\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 55/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 38/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019499/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   25.361      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   25.361      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4804-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163204 and revision id 20788. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"2025 Christmas Event","exists":true},{"title":"Santa Airdrop","exists":true}],"images":["Enchanted_Snowglobe.png"]}
